me":"Qualité M","type":"integer"},{"key":"Commentaire_français","x-originalName":"Commentaire français","type":"string","x-display":"textarea"},{"key":"Commentaire_anglais","x-originalName":"Commentaire anglais","type":"string","x-display":"textarea"},{"key":"Type_poste","x-originalName":"Type poste","type":"string"},{"key":"Nom_poste_français","x-originalName":"Nom poste français","type":"string"},{"key":"Nom_poste_anglais","x-originalName":"Nom poste anglais","type":"string"},{"key":"Nom_poste_espagnol","x-originalName":"Nom poste espagnol","type":"string"},{"key":"Total_poste_non_décomposé","x-originalName":"Total poste non décomposé","type":"number"},{"key":"CO2f","x-originalName":"CO2f","type":"number"},{"key":"CH4f","x-originalName":"CH4f","type":"number"},{"key":"CH4b","x-originalName":"CH4b","type":"number"},{"key":"N2O","x-originalName":"N2O","type":"number"},{"key":"Code_gaz_supplémentaire_1","x-originalName":"Code gaz supplémentaire 1","type":"string"},{"key":"Valeur_gaz_supplémentaire_1","x-originalName":"Valeur gaz supplémentaire 1","type":"number"},{"key":"Code_gaz_supplémentaire_2","x-originalName":"Code gaz supplémentaire 2","type":"string"},{"key":"Valeur_gaz_supplémentaire_2","x-originalName":"Valeur gaz supplémentaire 2","type":"number"},{"key":"Valeur_gaz_supplémentaire_3","x-originalName":"Valeur gaz supplémentaire 3","type":"boolean"},{"key":"Valeur_gaz_supplémentaire_4","x-originalName":"Valeur gaz supplémentaire 4","type":"boolean"},{"key":"Code_gaz_supplémentaire_5","x-originalName":"Code gaz supplémentaire 5","type":"string"},{"key":"Valeur_gaz_supplémentaire_5","x-originalName":"Valeur gaz supplémentaire 5","type":"boolean"},{"key":"Autres_GES","x-originalName":"Autres GES","type":"number"},{"key":"CO2b","x-originalName":"CO2b","type":"number"}],"props":{"linesDelimiter":"\r\n","fieldsDelimiter":";","escapeChar":"\"","quote":"\""}},"originalFile":{"name":"Base_Carbone_V23.6.csv","size":10761452,"mimetype":"text/csv","md5":"39583facdba0881a15f708693f25c793","encoding":"windows-1252"},"primaryKey":[],"count":18616,"finalizedAt":"2025-07-03T08:08:14.201Z","license":{"title":"Licence Ouverte / Open Licence","href":"https://www.etalab.gouv.fr/licence-ouverte-open-licence"},"topics":[{"title":"Changement climatique, adaptation","color":"#0070C0FF","id":"12fbcvpyjprbl0mvoqx08gdd","icon":{"name":"waves-arrow-up","svgPath":"M20 14H22V16H20C18.62 16 17.26 15.65 16 15C13.5 16.3 10.5 16.3 8 15C6.74 15.65 5.37 16 4 16H2V14H4C5.39 14 6.78 13.53 8 12.67C10.44 14.38 13.56 14.38 16 12.67C17.22 13.53 18.61 14 20 14M20 20H22V22H20C18.62 22 17.26 21.65 16 21C13.5 22.3 10.5 22.3 8 21C6.74 21.65 5.37 22 4 22H2V20H4C5.39 20 6.78 19.53 8 18.67C10.44 20.38 13.56 20.38 16 18.67C17.22 19.53 18.61 20 20 20M7 2L3 6H6V11H8V6H11M17 2L13 6H16V11H18V6H21"}}],"origin":"ADEME","frequency":"irregular","description":"**Version** : base carbone® V23.6\n\n**Voir** [le suivi des modifications apportées par la V23.6](https://data.ademe.fr/data-fair/api/v1/datasets/base-carboner/metadata-attachments/Tableau-de-suivi-v23-5-a-v23-6.xlsx)\n\nLa Base Carbone® est une base de données publique de facteurs d'émissions, nécessaires à la réalisation d’un bilan d’émissions de gaz à effet de serre (GES) et plus généralement tout exercice de comptabilité carbone.\n\nElle est la base de données de référence de l'article 75 de la loi Grenelle II, relatif à l’obligation de réalisation d’un Bilan GES pour les entreprises de plus de 500 salariés, les établissements publics de plus de 250 agents et les collectivités de plus de 50 000 habitants. Administrée par l'ADEME, sa gouvernance est multi acteurs : 14 membres la composent tels que le Ministère de la Transition écologique et solidaire (MTES), le Mouvement des entreprises de France (MEDEF), le Réseau Action Climat (RAC), l’Association des Professionnels en Conseil Climat (APCC), etc.\n\nRetrouvez le descriptif complet de la Base dans la rubrique « Base Carbone » du site Base Empreinte, ainsi que toute sa documentation explicitant périmètre et sources des données proposées pour s’assurer d’une utilisation robuste des données.\n\n**Pour toute question**, n’hésitez pas à nous contacter via base-empreinte@ademe.fr \n","publicationSites":["data-fair-portals:efWMeL1ZP","data-fair-portals:d60479cb-366f-4dc4-9f3f-1e9dd1a76c97"],"requestedPublicationSites":[],"analysis":{"escapeKeyAlgorithm":"legacy"},"slug":"base-carboner","publications":[],"attachments":[{"type":"file","title":"Suivi des modifications de la v23.2","name":"Tableau-de-suivi-v23-1-a-v23-2.xlsx","size":18594,"mimetype":"application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet","updatedAt":"2024-02-13T16:56:21.444Z","description":"Tableau de suivi de la v23.1 à la v23.2","url":"https://data.ademe.fr/data-fair/api/v1/datasets/base-carboner/metadata-attachments/Tableau-de-suivi-v23-1-a-v23-2.xlsx"},{"type":"file","includeInCatalogPublications":false,"title":"Suivi des modifications de la v23.3","name":"Tableau-de-suivi-v23-2-a-v23-3.xlsx","size":1233068,"mimetype":"application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet","updatedAt":"2024-07-26T06:50:12.108Z","description":"","url":"https://data.ademe.fr/data-fair/api/v1/datasets/base-carboner/metadata-attachments/Tableau-de-suivi-v23-2-a-v23-3.xlsx"},{"type":"file","includeInCatalogPublications":false,"name":"Tableau-de-suivi-v23-3-a-v23-4.xlsx","size":41389,"mimetype":"application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet","updatedAt":"2024-11-08T14:19:19.296Z","title":"Suiv des modifications de la version 23.3 à la version 23.4","description":"","url":"https://data.ademe.fr/data-fair/api/v1/datasets/base-carboner/metadata-attachments/Tableau-de-suivi-v23-3-a-v23-4.xlsx"},{"type":"file","includeInCatalogPublications":false,"name":"Tableau-de-suivi-v23-5-a-v23-6.xlsx","size":2987295,"mimetype":"application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet","updatedAt":"2025-07-03T08:09:11.006Z","title":"Suivi des modifications de la v23.5 à la v23.6","description":"","url":"https://data.ademe.fr/data-fair/api/v1/datasets/base-carboner/metadata-attachments/Tableau-de-suivi-v23-5-a-v23-6.xlsx"}],"spatial":"Non significatif","keywords":["GES"],"userPermissions":["list","readDescription","readSchema","readSafeSchema","readLines","getGeoAgg","getValuesAgg","getValues","getMetricAgg","getSimpleMetricsAgg","getWordsAgg","getMinAgg","getMaxAgg","downloadOriginalData","downloadFullData","readApiDoc","realtime-transactions","readLine","readLineRevisions","readRevisions","bulkSearch","listDataFiles","downloadDataFile","downloadMetadataAttachment","downloadAttachment","getReadApiKey","readCompatODSRecords","readCompatODSExports"],"public":true,"visibility":"public","previews":[{"id":"table","title":"Tableau","href":"https://data.ademe.fr/data-fair/embed/dataset/base-carboner/table"}],"href":"https://data.ademe.fr/data-fair/api/v1/datasets/base-carboner","page":"https://data.ademe.fr/datasets/base-carboner"}